n- **Each effective selection has one dispatched bundle.**\n  Scheduling, parallel sets, cycles and candidate validation share the document, fragment and matched-preset identity.\n- **Variant filenames have a precise recipe.**\n  Canonical UTF-8 JSON names supply the SHA-256 qualifier; filename collisions refuse publication.\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [W00 task #663](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/663) — the design contract and its scoped validation.\n- **R2.** [W00 delivery evidence](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md) — the immutable candidate pin, clause review and current-pin check limits.\n","created_at":"2026-11-06T09:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T10:35:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"77f18ad063e57041b64e7e7c8473ccd857589584","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/664/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/664/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/issues/664/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/statuses/1a7ccc7daf3f8a30d781231b8ef7d698f1741562","head":{"label":"m2ux:i10/e07/engineering","ref":"i10/e07/engineering","sha":"1a7ccc7daf3f8a30d781231b8ef7d698f1741562","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":